logs
*.pkl
*.json
*.log
*.png
validation.md
mlflow.db
figures/
# `results/*` rather than `results/`: git does not descend into an excluded *directory*, so a
# negation on files inside one never fires. Excluding the contents instead lets the write-up through.
results/*
# The write-up under results/ is source, not output — CLAUDE.md sends every reader to
# results/experiments.md and results/training_strategy.md first. Figures, .npz and .pkl stay out,
# since results/figures/ is itself matched by the rule above.
!results/*.md
!results/*.tex
mlartifacts/
